{"url": "https://wiki.idlecorp.xyz/api.php?format=json&formatversion=2&action=parse&page=Bauxite&prop=text%7Clinks%7Cimages%7Ctemplates%7Ccategories&redirects=1", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-09T14:55:19.267457+00:00", "body": "{\"parse\":{\"title\":\"Bauxite\",\"pageid\":55,\"redirects\":[],\"text\":\"<div class=\\\"mw-parser-output\\\"><p>Bauxite is a sedimentary rock with a relatively high aluminum content. It is the world's main source of aluminum. Bauxite can be mined using a <a href=\\\"/index.php/Bauxite_mine\\\" title=\\\"Bauxite mine\\\">Bauxite mine</a>.\\n</p>\\n<h2><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Bauxite_Production\\\">Bauxite Production</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Bauxite&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Bauxite Production\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h2>\\n<table class=\\\"wikitable sortable\\\">\\n<tbody><tr>\\n<th>Name</th>\\n<th>Cost</th>\\n<th>Inputs</th>\\n<th>Outputs</th>\\n<th>Profit/Min</th>\\n<th>Production <br />interval (MM:SS)\\n</th></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><a href=\\\"/index.php/Bauxite_mine\\\" title=\\\"Bauxite mine\\\">Bauxite mine</a></td>\\n<td>$150, 5,000x <a href=\\\"/index.php/Wood\\\" title=\\\"Wood\\\">wood</a>, 50x <a href=\\\"/index.php/Steel\\\" title=\\\"Steel\\\">steel</a></td>\\n<td>N/A</td>\\n<td>40x <a class=\\\"mw-selflink selflink\\\">bauxite</a></td>\\n<td>$9.60</td>\\n<td>0:25\\n</td></tr>\\n</tbody></table>\\n<h2><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Facilities_that_use_Bauxite\\\">Facilities that use Bauxite</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Bauxite&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Facilities that use Bauxite\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h2>\\n<table class=\\\"wikitable\\\">\\n<tbody><tr>\\n<th>Name</th>\\n<th>Cost</th>\\n<th>Inputs</th>\\n<th>Outputs</th>\\n<th>Profit/Min</th>\\n<th>Production interval (MM:SS)\\n</th></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><a href=\\\"/index.php/Aluminum_factory\\\" title=\\\"Aluminum factory\\\">Aluminum factory</a></td>\\n<td>$3,750</td>\\n<td>10x <a class=\\\"mw-selflink selflink\\\">bauxite</a></td>\\n<td>3x <a href=\\\"/index.php/Aluminum\\\" title=\\\"Aluminum\\\">aluminum</a></td>\\n<td>$26.40</td>\\n<td>0:25\\n</td></tr>\\n</tbody></table>\\n<!-- \\nNewPP limit report\\nCached time: 20261009001855\\nCache expiry: 86400\\nDynamic content: false\\nComplications: []\\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\\nReal time usage: 0.004 seconds\\nPreprocessor visited node count: 11/1000000\\nPreprocessor generated node count: 0/1000000\\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\\nHighest expansion depth: 2/40\\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\\n-->\\n<!--\\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\\n-->\\n\\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key icwiki:pcache:idhash:55-0!canonical and timestamp 20261009001855 and revision id 1141\\n -->\\n</div>\",\"categories\":[{\"sortkey\":\"\",\"category\":\"Asset\"}],\"links\":[{\"ns\":0,\"title\":\"Aluminum\",\"exists\":true},{\"ns\":0,\"title\":\"Aluminum factory\",\"exists\":true},{\"ns\":0,\"title\":\"Bauxite mine\",\"exists\":true},{\"ns\":0,\"title\":\"Steel\",\"exists\":true},{\"ns\":0,\"title\":\"Wood\",\"exists\":true}],\"templates\":[],\"images\":[]}}"}